n of the transform: with `ω^(2ᵏ⁻¹) ≡ -1` and `ω ω' ≡ 1` modulo `F`, transforming\n`z` by `ω` and the result by `ω'` gives `2ᵏ z`, modulo `F`.","docLink":"./MPN/FFT/Roots.html#MPN.FFT.inverse_mod","kind":"theorem","line":89,"name":"MPN.FFT.inverse_mod","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN/FFT/Roots.lean#L89-L163"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/FFT/Roots.html#MPN.FFT.exists_pow_two_neg_one\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">FFT</span>.<span class=\"name\">exists_pow_two_neg_one</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">w </span><span class=\"fn\">F </span><span class=\"fn\">k </span><span class=\"fn\">d</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hw</span> : (<span class=\"fn\">w</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> (<span class=\"fn\">k</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HSub.hSub\">-</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span>) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span>) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\">F</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hd</span> : <span class=\"fn\">0</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\">d</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hdk</span> : <span class=\"fn\">d</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">k</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Exists\">∃</a> <a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Exists\">(</a><span class=\"fn\">s</span> <a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Exists\">:</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a><a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Exists\">)</a><a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Exists\">,</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\">k</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#And\">∧</a> ((<span class=\"fn\">w</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">d</span>) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span>) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\">F</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"When `ω^(2ᵏ⁻¹) ≡ -1` modulo `F`, every power `ωᵈ` with `0 < d < 2ᵏ` has a power `(ωᵈ)^(2ˢ)`,\n`s < k`, that is `-1` modulo `F`: with `d = 2ᵛ u`, `u` odd, take `s = k - 1 - v`.","docLink":"./MPN/FFT/Roots.html#MPN.FFT.exists_pow_two_neg_one","kind":"theorem","line":70,"name":"MPN.FFT.exists_pow_two_neg_one","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN/FFT/Roots.lean#L70-L87"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/FFT/Roots.html#MPN.FFT.exists_two_pow_mul_odd\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">FFT</span>.<span class=\"name\">exists_two_pow_mul_odd</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">d</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hd</span> : <span class=\"fn\">0</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\">d</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Exists\">∃</a> <a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Exists\">(</a><span class=\"fn\">v</span> <a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Exists\">:</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a><a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Exists\">)</a><a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Exists\">,</a> <a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Exists\">∃</a> <a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Exists\">(</a><span class=\"fn\">u</span> <a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Exists\">:</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a><a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Exists\">)</a><a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Exists\">,</a> <span class=\"fn\">d</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">v</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">u</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#And\">∧</a> <span class=\"fn\">u</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Every positive `d` is `2ᵛ u` with `u` odd.","docLink":"./MPN/FFT/Roots.html#MPN.FFT.exists_two_pow_mul_odd","kind":"theorem","line":60,"name":"MPN.FFT.exists_two_pow_mul_odd","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN/FFT/Roots.lean#L60-L68"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/FFT/Roots.html#MPN.FFT.sumRange_pow_two_mod\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">FFT</span>.<span class=\"name\">sumRange_pow_two_mod</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">x </span><span class=\"fn\">k </span><span class=\"fn\">s </span><span class=\"fn\">F</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hs</span> : <span class=\"fn\">s</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\">k</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hx</span> : (<span class=\"fn\">x</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span>) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\">F</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Sum.html#MPN.sumRange\">sumRange</a> <span class=\"fn\">(fun (<span class=\"fn\">x_1</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>) =&gt; <span class=\"fn\">x</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">x_1</span>)</span> (<span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">k</span>)</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\">F</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"When some `x^(2ˢ)`, `s < k`, is `-1` modulo `F`, the geometric sum of length `2ᵏ` vanishes.","docLink":"./MPN/FFT/Roots.html#MPN.FFT.sumRange_pow_two_mod","kind":"theorem","line":46,"name":"MPN.FFT.sumRange_pow_two_mod","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN/FFT/Roots.lean#L46-L56"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/FFT/Roots.html#MPN.FFT.sumRange_pow_two_succ\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">FFT</span>.<span class=\"name\">sumRange_pow_two_succ</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x </span><span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Sum.html#MPN.sumRange\">sumRange</a> <span class=\"fn\">(fun (<span class=\"fn\">x_1</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>) =&gt; <span class=\"fn\">x</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">x_1</span>)</span> (<span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> (<span class=\"fn\">k</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span>))</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Sum.html#MPN.sumRange\">sumRange</a> <span class=\"fn\">(fun (<span class=\"fn\">x_1</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>) =&gt; <span class=\"fn\">x</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">x_1</span>)</span> (<span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">k</span>)</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> (<span class=\"fn\">1</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">x</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">k</span>)</div></div>","info":{"doc":"`1 + x + ⋯ + x^(2ᵏ⁺¹ - 1) = (1 + x + ⋯ + x^(2ᵏ - 1)) (1 + x^(2ᵏ))`.","docLink":"./MPN/FFT/Roots.html#MPN.FFT.sumRange_pow_two_succ","kind":"theorem","line":32,"name":"MPN.FFT.sumRange_pow_two_succ","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN/FFT/Roots.lean#L32-L44"}}],"imports":["Init","MPN.NatMod","MPN.Sum"],"instances":[],"name":"MPN.FFT.Roots"}